<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P puts Yamaichi Sec debts on &quot;Credit Watch&quot;.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts Yamaichi Sec debts on &quot;Credit Watch&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday that it had placed its BBB+ long-term debt and counterparty ratings of Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd on &quot;Credit Watch&quot; for negative implications.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P will evaluate Yamaichi's weakening financial performance, its position in the industry and the potential impact on the securities company from Japan's &quot;Big Bang&quot; financial deregulations, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
